# Private data patches (see apply_patches()). These hold identifiable, real
# corrections and must NEVER be committed -- treat them like raw data. The only
# patch file in the repo is the synthetic inst/extdata/example_patches.csv,
# which documents the format and is deliberately NOT ignored below.
*_patches.csv
*_patches.rds
patches/
!inst/extdata/example_patches.csv
